{"custom_field": "প্রতি প্রশ্নের মান ১ ও ভুল উত্তরের জন্য ০.২৫ কাটা যাবে।", "question_text": {"DPE-Daily-Quiz": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) tan&theta; = 5/12 হলে, sec&theta; - cos&theta; এর মান কত? ", "option1": "27/156", "option2": "25/156", "option3": "25/146", "option4": "27/146", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><strong>প্রশ্ন:</strong> tan&theta; = 5/12 হলে, sec&theta; - cos&theta; এর মান কত?<br /><br /><strong>সমাধান:</strong><br />tan&theta; = 5/12<br />&there4; লম্ব/ভূমি = 5/12<br />&there4; অতিভুজ = &radic;{(12)<sup>2</sup> + (5)<sup>2</sup>} = 13<br /><br />প্রদত্ত রাশি = sec&theta; - cos&theta;<br />= (13/12) - (12/13)<br />= (169 - 144)/156<br />= 25/156</p>"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) কোন সম্পর্কটি সঠিক নয়?", "option1": "sin<sup>2</sup>&theta; + cos<sup>2</sup>&theta; = 1", "option2": "sec<sup>2</sup>&theta; - tan<sup>2</sup>&theta; = 1", "option3": "tan<sup>2</sup>&theta; - cot<sup>2</sup>&theta; = 1", "option4": "cosec<sup>2</sup>&theta; - cot<sup>2</sup>&theta; = 1", "answer": "3", "exp": "<strong>ত্রিকোণমিতিক অনুপাতগুলোর সম্পর্ক:&nbsp;</strong><br />sin<sup>2</sup>&theta; + cos<sup>2</sup>&theta; = 1<br />sec<sup>2</sup>&theta; - tan<sup>2</sup>&theta; = 1<br />cosec<sup>2</sup>&theta; - cot<sup>2</sup>&theta; = 1"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20241015_7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"245\" height=\"78\" />", "option1": "- Sin&theta;", "option2": "-Cos&theta;", "option3": "Sin&theta;", "option4": "Cos&theta;", "answer": "2", "exp": "<strong>সমাধান:</strong><br /><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2024-10-16_172450.png\" alt=\"\" />"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20240928_4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"342\" height=\"35\" />", "option1": "30&deg;", "option2": "60&deg;", "option3": "45&deg;", "option4": "90&deg;", "answer": "2", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20240928_5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"188\" height=\"207\" />"}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20241015_3_3WIkfzu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"483\" height=\"35\" />", "option1": "2", "option2": "1", "option3": "1/2", "option4": "1/3", "answer": "3", "exp": "<strong>সমাধান:</strong><br /><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20241015_4_owmoXkU.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"377\" height=\"264\" />"}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) A = 45&deg; হলে, cosA.sin2A এর মান কত?", "option1": "- 1/&radic;2", "option2": "1/2", "option3": "1/&radic;2", "option4": "1", "answer": "3", "exp": "<strong>প্রশ্ন:</strong> A = 45&deg; হলে, cosA.sin2A এর মান কত?<br /><br /><strong>সমাধান:</strong><br />cos2A.sinA = cos45&deg;sin90&deg;<br />= (1/&radic;2) &times; 1<br />= 1/&radic;2<br />"}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) sin225&deg; = কত?", "option1": " - 1/&radic;2", "option2": "1/&radic;2", "option3": "&radic;2/3", "option4": "1", "answer": "1", "exp": "<strong>প্রশ্ন:</strong> sin225&deg; = কত?<br /><br /><strong>সমাধান:</strong><br />sin225&deg; = sin(2 &times; 90&deg; + 45&deg;)<br />= - sin45&deg;<br />= -1/&radic;2"}, {"id": "8", "question": "৮) সূর্যের উন্নতি কোণ ৬০° হলে একটি গাছের ছায়ার দৈর্ঘ্য ১০√৩ মিটার হয়। গাছটির উচ্চতা কত?", "option1": "২০ মি.", "option2": "৩০ মি.", "option3": "২৫ মি.", "option4": "৪৫ মি.", "answer": "2", "exp": "<strong>প্রশ্ন:</strong> সূর্যের উন্নতি কোণ ৬০&deg; হলে একটি গাছের ছায়ার দৈর্ঘ্য ১০&radic;৩ মিটার হয়। গাছটির উচ্চতা কত?<br /><br /><strong>সমাধান:&nbsp;</strong><br /><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2024-09-28_172129.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"206\" height=\"206\" /><br />ধরি,<br />উচ্চতা = h<br />tan60&deg; = h/10&radic;3<br />&radic;3 = h/10&radic;3<br />h = 3 &times; 10<br />h = 30"}, {"id": "9", "question": "৯) 180&deg; = কত রেডিয়ান?", "option1": "2&pi;/3", "option2": "&pi;/2", "option3": "&pi;/3", "option4": "&pi;", "answer": "4", "exp": "আমরা জানি,<br />2&pi; রেডিয়ান = 360&deg;<br />&there4; 180&deg; = &pi; রেডিয়ান"}, {"id": "10", "question": "১০) sin<sup>2</sup>25&deg; + sin<sup>2</sup>65&deg; = কত?", "option1": "1/2", "option2": "1", "option3": "&radic;3/2", "option4": "&radic;2", "answer": "2", "exp": "<strong>প্রশ্ন:</strong> sin<sup>2</sup>25&deg; + sin<sup>2</sup>65&deg; = কত?<br /><br /><strong>সমাধান:</strong><br />sin<sup>2</sup>25&deg; + sin<sup>2</sup>65&deg;<br />= sin<sup>2</sup>25&deg; + sin<sup>2</sup>(90&deg; - 25&deg;)<br />= sin<sup>2</sup>25&deg; + cos<sup>2</sup>25&deg;<br />= 1"}, {"id": "11", "question": "১১) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20241015_u7xH2sc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"389\" height=\"71\" />", "option1": "4/3", "option2": "- 4/3", "option3": "3/4", "option4": "- 3/4", "answer": "1", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20241015_2_0HxjI5z.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"387\" height=\"338\" />"}, {"id": "12", "question": "১২) সূর্যের উন্নতি কোণ কত হলে একটি গাছের ছায়া তার দৈর্ঘ্যের √3 গুণ হবে?", "option1": "30&deg;", "option2": "45&deg;", "option3": "90&deg;", "option4": "60&deg;", "answer": "1", "exp": "<strong>প্রশ্ন:</strong> সূর্যের উন্নতি কোণ কত হলে একটি গাছের ছায়া তার দৈর্ঘ্যের &radic;3 গুণ হবে?<br /><br /><strong>সমধান:&nbsp;</strong><br />ধরি সূর্যের উন্নতি কোণ = &theta;<br />গাছের দৈর্ঘ্য = x<br />ছায়ার দৈর্ঘ্য = &radic;3x<br /><br />আমরা জানি,<br />tan&theta; = লম্ব/ভূমি<br />tan&theta; = x/&radic;3x<br />tan&theta; = 1/&radic;3<br />&theta; = 30"}, {"id": "13", "question": "১৩) rsin&theta; = &radic;3 এবং rcos&theta; = 1&nbsp;হলে, (&radic;3tan<sup>2</sup>&theta; + &radic;3) = কত?", "option1": "9&radic;3", "option2": "8&radic;3", "option3": "4&radic;3", "option4": "11&radic;3", "answer": "3", "exp": "প্রশ্ন: rsin&theta; = &radic;3 এবং rcos&theta; = 1&nbsp;হলে, (&radic;3tan<sup>2</sup>&theta; + &radic;3) = কত?<br /><br />সমাধান:&nbsp;<br /><br /><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20241015_13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"212\" height=\"296\" />"}, {"id": "14", "question": "১৪) একটি খাড়া খুঁটি মাটি থেকে ৫ মিটার উপরে ভেঙ্গে বিচ্ছিন্ন না হয়ে অন্যপ্রান্ত খুঁটিটির গোড়া থেকে ১২ মিটার দূরে ভূমি স্পর্শ করলো, খুঁটিটির উচ্চতা কত?", "option1": "২১ মিটার", "option2": "১৫ মিটার", "option3": "১৬ মিটার", "option4": "১৮ মিটার", "answer": "4", "exp": "প্রশ্ন: একটি খাড়া খুঁটি মাটি থেকে ৫ মিটার উপরে ভেঙ্গে বিচ্ছিন্ন না হয়ে অন্যপ্রান্ত খুঁটিটির গোড়া থেকে ১২ মিটার দূরে ভূমি স্পর্শ করলো, খুঁটিটির উচ্চতা কত?<br /><br />সমাধান:&nbsp;<br /><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Screenshot_2024-10-15_155615.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"389\" height=\"303\" /><br />ধরি,<br />খুঁটির উচ্চতা = h<br />পীথাগোরাসের সূত্রানুয়ায়ি,<br />(h - 5)<sup>2</sup> = 5<sup>2</sup> + 12<sup>2</sup><br />(h - 5)<sup>2</sup> = 13<sup>2</sup><br />h - 5 = 13<br />h = 18"}, {"id": "15", "question": "১৫) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20241015_5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"369\" height=\"33\" />", "option1": "1/3", "option2": "3", "option3": "&radic;3", "option4": "1/&radic;3", "answer": "1", "exp": "<strong>সমাধান:</strong><br /><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20241015_6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"197\" height=\"191\" />"}]}, "exam_time": 1020000, "pk": 8041, "is_omr": false, "omr_time": 7200000, "is_